      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּ֫בַע</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar.</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:17\" href=\"/Joshua.21.17\">Js 21.17</a> +; construto <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:10\" href=\"/Judges.20.10\">Jz 20.10</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֑בַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:24\" href=\"/Joshua.18.24\">Js 18.24</a> +;—cidade levítica, em Benjamim <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:17\" href=\"/Joshua.21.17\">Js 21.17</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.45\">1Cr 6.45</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:24\" href=\"/Joshua.18.24\">Js 18.24</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.6\">1Cr 8.6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.22\">1Rs 15.22</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.31\">Ne 11.31</a>; também <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.16\">1Sm 13.16</a> e <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:10\" href=\"/Judges.20.10\">Jz 20.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:33\" href=\"/Judges.20.33\">Jz 20.33</a> TM, em todos os três leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">(גִּבְעַת) גִּבְעָה</span>, cf. contexto;—cidade mais setentrional do reino de Judá <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.8\">2Rs 23.8</a> <em>de Geba a Berseba</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.10\">Zc 14.10</a>; situada ao sul da passagem de <em>Micmás</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.29\">Is 10.29</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.5\">1Sm 14.5</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.3\">1Sm 13.3</a>; mencionada também <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.6\">2Cr 16.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:26\" href=\"/Ezra.2.26\">Ed 2.26</a> <span data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:29\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Nehemiah.7.29\" data-bdbh-source-label=\"Ne 7:30\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"BIBLE_LABEL_REF_MISMATCH\">Ne 7.30</span>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.29\">Ne 12.29</a>; em <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.18\">1Sm 13.18</a> 𝔊 We Dr leem <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגֶּבַע</span> em lugar do TM <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּל</span>, veja-se esse verbete; (<a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.25\">2Sm 5.25</a> leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">גבעון</span> com 𝔊 e <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.16\">1Cr 14.16</a>).—Moderno <em>Jebaʿ</em> Rob<sup>BR i. 440 f.</sup> Bd<sup>Pal 120</sup>.",
