      "html": "II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעָה</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar (</strong><em>colina</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:57\" href=\"/Joshua.15.57\">Js 15.57</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">(הַ)גִּבְעָ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:4\" href=\"/Judges.20.4\">Jz 20.4</a> + 5 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:28\" href=\"/Joshua.18.28\">Js 18.28</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.4\">1Sm 11.4</a> + 9 vezes; absoluto sempre com artigo exceto <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:57\" href=\"/Joshua.15.57\">Js 15.57</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:28\" href=\"/Joshua.18.28\">Js 18.28</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:12\" href=\"/Judges.19.12\">Jz 19.12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:31\" href=\"/Judges.20.31\">Jz 20.31</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.26\">1Sm 10.26</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.2\">2Cr 13.2</a>;—<br>†<strong>1.</strong>  uma cidade de Judá <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:57\" href=\"/Joshua.15.57\">Js 15.57</a> (talvez uma das duas aldeias chamadas <em>Gabaa, Gabatha</em> em Onom. veja-se Lag<sup>Onom. 246, 128; 2nd ed. 255, 160</sup>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  cidade de Benjamim <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:14\" href=\"/Judges.19.14\">Jz 19.14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:16\" href=\"/Judges.19.16\">Jz 19.16</a> + 20 vezes em Jz, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.26\">1Sm 10.26</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.2\">1Sm 14.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.6\">1Sm 22.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.1\">1Sm 26.1</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.29\">2Sm 23.29</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.31\">1Cr 11.31</a>; também <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:8\" href=\"/Hosea.5.8\">Os 5.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:9\" href=\"/Hosea.9.9\">Os 9.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:9\" href=\"/Hosea.10.9\">Os 10.9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:12\" href=\"/Judges.19.12\">Jz 19.12ff</a>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.2\">2Cr 13.2</a>; talvez também <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.1\">1Sm 7.1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.10\">1Sm 10.10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.3\">2Sm 6.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.4\">2Sm 6.4</a> leia-se também (em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">גבע</span>) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.16\">1Sm 13.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:10\" href=\"/Judges.20.10\">Jz 20.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:33\" href=\"/Judges.20.33\">Jz 20.33</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:28\" href=\"/Joshua.18.28\">Js 18.28</a>; chamada também <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת בִּנְיָמִין</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.2\">1Sm 13.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.15\">1Sm 13.15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.16\">1Sm 14.16</a>, e <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת שָׁאוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.4\">1Sm 11.4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.34\">1Sm 15.34</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.29\">Is 10.29</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.6\">2Sm 21.6</a> leia-se provavelmente <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעוֹן</span>, 𝔊 We Dr.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  uma cidade de Efraim, chamada <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת פִּֽינְחָס</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:33\" href=\"/Joshua.24.33\">Js 24.33</a>.",
