      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבִיעַ</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:12\" href=\"/Genesis.44.12\">Gn 44.12</a></sup> <strong>taça, tigela</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:12\" href=\"/Genesis.44.12\">Gn 44.12</a> + 2 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִיעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:2\" href=\"/Genesis.44.2\">Gn 44.2</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִיעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:2\" href=\"/Genesis.44.2\">Gn 44.2</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִיעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:34\" href=\"/Exodus.25.34\">Êx 25.34</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִעִים</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:33\" href=\"/Exodus.25.33\">Êx 25.33</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 4 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִיעֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:31\" href=\"/Exodus.25.31\">Êx 25.31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:17\" href=\"/Exodus.34.17\">Êx 34.17</a>;—<em>taça</em> (de José) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:2\" href=\"/Genesis.44.2\">Gn 44.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:12\" href=\"/Genesis.44.12\">Gn 44.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:16\" href=\"/Genesis.44.16\">Gn 44.16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:17\" href=\"/Genesis.44.17\">Gn 44.17</a>; plural <em>taças</em> (do candelabro de ouro no tabernáculo) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:31\" href=\"/Exodus.25.31\">Êx 25.31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:33\" href=\"/Exodus.25.33\">Êx 25.33</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:34\" href=\"/Exodus.25.34\">Êx 25.34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:17\" href=\"/Exodus.37.17\">Êx 37.17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:19\" href=\"/Exodus.37.19\">Êx 37.19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:20\" href=\"/Exodus.37.20\">Êx 37.20</a>; <em>tigelas</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.5\">Jr 35.5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִעִים מלאים יין וכֹסוֹת</span>.",
