      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעוֹן</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio de lugar.</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:17\" href=\"/Joshua.9.17\">Js 9.17</a> +; com <span dir=\"rtl\">ָה</span> locativo, <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְע֫וֹנָה</span> <span data-ref=\"II Samuel 12\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/II_Samuel.12\" data-bdbh-source-label=\"2 S 12\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"BIBLE_CONTEXT_MISMATCH\">2Sm 12</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.4\">1Rs 3.4</a>;—cidade levítica na tribo de Benjamim; anteriormente habitada por heveus <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:17\" href=\"/Joshua.9.17\">Js 9.17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:2\" href=\"/Joshua.10.2\">Js 10.2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:4\" href=\"/Joshua.10.4\">Js 10.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">Js 10.5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Js 10.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:12\" href=\"/Joshua.10.12\">Js 10.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:41\" href=\"/Joshua.10.41\">Js 10.41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:19\" href=\"/Joshua.11.19\">Js 11.19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:25\" href=\"/Joshua.18.25\">Js 18.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:17\" href=\"/Joshua.21.17\">Js 21.17</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.12\">2Sm 2.12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.13\">2Sm 2.13</a> (<em>piscina de Gibeão</em>) versículo <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.16\">2Sm 2.16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.30\">2Sm 3.30</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.8\">2Sm 20.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.1\">Jr 28.1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.12\">Jr 41.12</a> (<em>grandes águas que estão em Gibeão</em>) versículo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.16\">Jr 41.16</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.16\">1Cr 14.16</a>; vejam-se especialmente <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹשְׁבֵי ג׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:3\" href=\"/Joshua.9.3\">Js 9.3</a> (chamados heveus <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:7\" href=\"/Joshua.9.7\">Js 9.7</a>) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:1\" href=\"/Joshua.10.1\">Js 10.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:6\" href=\"/Joshua.10.6\">Js 10.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:19\" href=\"/Joshua.11.19\">Js 11.19</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.7\">Ne 3.7</a>, assim <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ג׳</span> <span data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:24\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Nehemiah.7.24\" data-bdbh-source-label=\"Ne 7:25\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"BIBLE_LABEL_REF_MISMATCH\">Ne 7.25</span> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי גִבָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:20\" href=\"/Ezra.2.20\">Ed 2.20</a>, veja-se <a data-ref=\"BDB, גִּבָּר\" href=\"/BDB,_גִּבָּר\", dir=\"rtl\">גִּבָּר</a>); cf. também como nome próprio masculino <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.29\">1Cr 8.29</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבְגִבְעוֹן יָֽשְׁבוּ אֲבִי גִבְעוֹן</span> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.35\">1Cr 9.35</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְבַּר ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.24\">2Sm 2.24</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵמֶק בְּג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.21\">Is 28.21</a>; era o lugar de uma grande <em>Bamah</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.4\">1Rs 3.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.5\">1Rs 3.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.2\">1Rs 9.2</a>, onde estava ‘o tabernáculo de Yahweh no lugar alto’ segundo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.39\">1Cr 16.39</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.29\">1Cr 21.29</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.3\">2Cr 1.3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.13\">2Cr 1.13</a>.",
