      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּג</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino. telhado, parte superior (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> Di compara etiópico ጋግ, ጋጋ <em>vinculum</em> (<em>ferreum</em>, vínculo de ferro), <em>jugo</em> (jugo), <em>collare ferreum</em> (colar de ferro); raiz duvidosa; Thes propõe <span dir=\"rtl\">גנג</span>; talvez <span dir=\"rtl\">גנג</span> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">גנגן</span>) <em>cobrir</em> Bö<sup>§ 292</sup> Sta<sup>§ 189 a</sup> MV<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:6\" href=\"/Joshua.2.6\">Js 2.6</a> + 9 vezes + <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.26\">1Sm 9.26</a> Ketiv (Qerê <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֫גָה</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֫גָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:6\" href=\"/Joshua.2.6\">Js 2.6</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.26\">1Sm 9.26</a> Qerê (Ketiv <span dir=\"rtl\">גג</span>); construto <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:51\" href=\"/Judges.9.51\">Jz 9.51</a> + 2 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.13\">Ez 40.13</a> (Co suprime, veja-se abaixo); com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּגֶּ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.8\">Dt 22.8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּגּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:3\" href=\"/Exodus.30.3\">Êx 30.3</a> + 2 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.13\">Ez 40.13</a> (Co suprime, veja-se abaixo); plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּגּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37.27</a> + 5 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּגּוֹתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.3\">Is 15.3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּגּוֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.29\">Jr 32.29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּגֹּתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.13\">Jr 19.13</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>telhado</em> (de casa) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.8\">Dt 22.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:6\" href=\"/Joshua.2.6\">Js 2.6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:8\" href=\"/Joshua.2.8\">Js 2.8</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:27\" href=\"/Judges.16.27\">Jz 16.27</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:25\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.25\">1Sm 9.25</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.26\">1Sm 9.26</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.2\">2Sm 11.2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.22\">2Sm 16.22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.26\">2Rs 19.26</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37.27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.16\">Ne 8.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:8\" href=\"/Psalms.102.8\">Sl 102.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 129:6\" href=\"/Psalms.129.6\">Sl 129.6</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.9\">Pv 21.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.24\">Pv 25.24</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.3\">Is 15.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.1\">Is 22.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.38\">Jr 48.38</a>; como lugares de culto idolátrico (especialmente de corpos celestes) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.13\">Jr 19.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.29\">Jr 32.29</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:5\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.5\">Sf 1.5</a>; assim <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגָּג עֲלִיַּת אָחָז</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.12\">2Rs 23.12</a>, terraço de torre <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:51\" href=\"/Judges.9.51\">Jz 9.51</a>, sobre a porta <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.24\">2Sm 18.24</a>, de câmara <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.13\">Ez 40.13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (mas 𝔊 Co <span dir=\"rtl\">קיר</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  parte superior do altar de incenso, no tabernáculo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:3\" href=\"/Exodus.30.3\">Êx 30.3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:26\" href=\"/Exodus.37.26\">Êx 37.26</a> (ambos P).",
