      "html": "I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּד</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:19\" href=\"/Genesis.49.19\">Gn 49.19</a></sup> <strong>bando, tropa (</strong>enquanto <em>faz incursões;</em> outros, como uma <em>divisão, destacamento</em> (enquanto separado), mas isto geralmente mais tardio no hebraico<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.8\">1Sm 30.8</a> + 19 vezes; construto <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.9\">2Cr 25.9</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.2\">2Sm 4.2</a> + 2 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.23\">2Rs 6.23</a> + 6 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּדָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:12\" href=\"/Job.19.12\">Jó 19.12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 25:3\" href=\"/Job.25.3\">Jó 25.3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>bando de saqueadores</em> (fazendo <em>incursões, invasões</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גָּדַד\" href=\"/BDB,_גָּדַד\", dir=\"rtl\">גדד</a>) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.8\">1Sm 30.8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.15\">1Sm 30.15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.23\">1Sm 30.23</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.22\">1Cr 12.22</a>, também <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.1\">2Cr 22.1</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.24\">1Rs 11.24</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.2\">2Rs 5.2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.23\">2Rs 6.23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.20\">2Rs 13.20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.21\">2Rs 13.21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.2\">2Rs 24.2</a><sup>(×4)</sup> cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.30\">2Sm 22.30</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:30\" href=\"/Psalms.18.30\">Sl 18.30</a>, e <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:19\" href=\"/Genesis.49.19\">Gn 49.19</a> (veja-se <span data-ref=\"BDB, גַּד²\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/BDB,_גַּד²\" data-bdbh-source-label=\"גַּד\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"LEXICAL_CONTEXT_MISMATCH\">גַּד</span> 30.11) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:9\" href=\"/Hosea.6.9\">Os 6.9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:1\" href=\"/Hosea.7.1\">Os 7.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.22\">Jr 18.22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂרֵי גְּדוּדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.2\">2Sm 4.2</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְּנֵם בְּרָאשֵׁי הַגְּדוּד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.19\">1Cr 12.19</a>; figurado das forças atacantes de Deus, seus castigos <a data-ref=\"Job 19:12\" href=\"/Job.19.12\">Jó 19.12</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 25:3\" href=\"/Job.25.3\">Jó 25.3</a> abaixo)<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>tropa</em>, de divisões do exército de Israel (tardio) <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוּדֵי צְבָא מִלְחָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.4\">1Cr 7.4</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.11\">2Cr 26.11</a>; <em>bando de Israel</em>, isto é, tropa de mercenários contratados de Israel por Amazias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.9\">2Cr 25.9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.10\">2Cr 25.10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הַגְּדוּד</span> isto é, <em>soldados do bando</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.13\">2Cr 25.13</a>; do exército em geral <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמֶלֶךְ בַּגְּדוּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:25\" href=\"/Job.29.25\">Jó 29.25</a>, em comparação; também <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:14\" href=\"/Micah.4.14\">Mq 4.14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּת־גְּדוּד</span> de Sião.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>incursão, ataque de surpresa</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.22\">2Sm 3.22</a>.",
