      "preview": "גָּד: nome próprio masculino: Gade; filho de Jacó, tribo e profeta.",
      "html": "III. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּד</span></big><sub>71</sub>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>fortunatus</em> (afortunado)? talvez derivado do nome divino precedente Siegf<sup>JPTh 1875, 364</sup> Sta<sup>Gesch. i. 148</sup>; mas veja-se também Bae<sup>Rel. 159 f.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֥ד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:26\" href=\"/Genesis.35.26\">Gn 35.26</a> +, bem como <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּד֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:11\" href=\"/Genesis.30.11\">Gn 30.11</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  filho de Jacó e Zilpa; <strong>a.</strong>  estritamente como nome pessoal <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:11\" href=\"/Genesis.30.11\">Gn 30.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:26\" href=\"/Genesis.35.26\">Gn 35.26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:16\" href=\"/Genesis.46.16\">Gn 46.16</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:4\" href=\"/Exodus.1.4\">Êx 1.4</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:19\" href=\"/Genesis.49.19\">Gn 49.19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.2\">1Cr 2.2</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  como nome de tribo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:14\" href=\"/Numbers.1.14\">Nm 1.14</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.13\">Dt 27.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.20\">Dt 33.20</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:7\" href=\"/Joshua.18.7\">Js 18.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.27\">Ez 48.27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.28\">Ez 48.28</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ גָּד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.7\">1Sm 13.7</a> veja-se também <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.1\">Jr 49.1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעַר גָּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.34\">Ez 48.34</a>, sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנַּחַל הַגָּד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.5\">2Sm 24.5</a> cf. We Dr; explicitamente <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֵּה גָּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:25\" href=\"/Numbers.1.25\">Nm 1.25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:14\" href=\"/Numbers.2.14\">Nm 2.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:15\" href=\"/Numbers.13.15\">Nm 13.15</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:24\" href=\"/Joshua.13.24\">Js 13.24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:8\" href=\"/Joshua.20.8\">Js 20.8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:7\" href=\"/Joshua.21.7\">Js 21.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:36\" href=\"/Joshua.21.36\">Js 21.36</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:48\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.48\">1Cr 6.48</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:65\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.65\">1Cr 6.65</a>; uma vez, <span dir=\"rtl\">צְבָא מַטֵּה בְנֵי־גָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:20\" href=\"/Numbers.10.20\">Nm 10.20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי גָד</span> (MI<sup>10</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">אש גד</span>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:24\" href=\"/Numbers.1.24\">Nm 1.24</a> + 12 vezes em Nm; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:12\" href=\"/Joshua.4.12\">Js 4.12</a> + 14 vezes em Js; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.11\">1Cr 5.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.14\">1Cr 12.14</a>.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  um profeta no tempo de Davi, chamado <span dir=\"rtl\">נָבִיא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.5\">1Sm 22.5</a>, mas <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנָּבִיא חֹזֶה דָוִד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.11\">2Sm 24.11</a> e <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹזֵה דָוִיד</span> ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.9\">1Cr 21.9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹזֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.29\">1Cr 29.29</a> e <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹזֵה־הַמֶּלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.25\">2Cr 29.25</a>. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִגְדַּל־גַּד</span> veja-se p. 154.",
